  "title": "钓鱼模拟游戏《渔力全开》销量突破一百万份",
  "content": "<img src=\"https://image.gcores.com/b6b4e29e974729b7f637915695429ee6-920-430.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_fill,w_626,h_292/quality,q_90\" /><p>距离发售不到一周，由 Dazed Games 打造的钓鱼模拟游戏《渔力全开》销量突破一百万。开发者表示，将会持续增加新内容并修复 Bug ，也感谢所有玩家的支持。本作是一款物理交互的钓鱼模拟游戏，支持最多4名玩家游玩。</p><div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/c9af697d5fb06dafb54e07d6864c170a-1920-1080.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure></div><div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/2f8867f4f8f03ae97f690827b9fe50f9-1920-1080.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure></div><div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/5496665f3b426f5dbfcdec905b0e34ff-1920-1080.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure></div><div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/fe6a3773532f5f340771924b0d5a0036-1920-1080.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure></div><p>本作中，玩家喝着酒驾着船突然撞上了一座小岛。为了能安全回家，必须学会​​钓鱼。玩家可以在游戏钓鱼、杀鱼、卖鱼；完成各种任务，击杀各种首领，前往更危险的新岛屿，获取更好的装备。</p><div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/c253f5eeaafb9dec46211e124d4b0423-1920-1080.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure></div><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
